{"title":"工程造价咨询企业资质将成为历史","date":"2021-06-07","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;color:black\">工程造价咨询企业资质将成为历史</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;color:black\">6</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;color:black\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>日，国务院发布《关于深化&ldquo;证照分离&rdquo;改革进一步激发市场主体发展活力的通知》（国发〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2021</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>号）。《通知》明确指出，工程造价咨询企业甲级、乙级资质证书在全国范围内正式取消审批，自<span lang=\"EN-US\">2021</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日内实施。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202106/123.jpg\" style=\"width: 1098px; height: 662px;\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;mso-pagination:none\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;mso-pagination:none\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">取消了企业造价资质，对企业及从业者会产生哪些影响呢？</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">1</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black\">、市场竞争加剧</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">此次的政策调整，将注重资质转变为对注重工程项目本身的监管，在没有门槛限制的情况下，从事造价咨询上下游业务的企业都会进入市场，甚至没有一点经验的门外汉可能也会进入分一杯羹，从而加剧市场的竞争。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; line-height: 200%;\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">2</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black\">、市场缺口进一步扩大</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">取消对造价企业的资质审批要求，那些单纯用挂靠证书的将被全面清理。但工程项目对证书的需求依然存在，市场的持证人才将会供不应求，工程项目缺证的现象会变得更加严重。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.8pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">3</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black\">、重人才轻公司</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:200%;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">&ldquo;证照分离&rdquo;的改革，意味着人在哪个项目，证也必须在哪个项目，对于企业而言，&ldquo;资质竞争&rdquo;将转变为&ldquo;人才竞争&rdquo;，其实也就是公司持证人才数量的竞争。个人资质和能力将更受重视，同时，企业也将对管理和技术人才的素质提出更高的要求。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; line-height: 200%;\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">4</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black\">、证书含金量变得更高</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;line-height:200%;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">在不久的将来，全员持证将成为行业新趋势。从业人员为了证明自己、助推事业而大量考证，包含甲方工程管理人员、第三方咨询人员、施工方以及行业监管人员等，考证需求增长，造价师正式也会显得更为紧俏，含金量也会更高。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.8pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nline-height:200%\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">5</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black\">、事中事后监管变得更加严格</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;line-height:200%;color:black\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">不管是什么资质，取消后的事中事后监管都会变得更加严格，监管思路将从&ldquo;管主体&rdquo;向&ldquo;管行为&rdquo;转变，监管重点将从&ldquo;管企业&rdquo;向&ldquo;管项目&rdquo;转变，从园林绿化资质、物业资质、招标代理资质取消的先例就可以看出来。在相应的配套措施没有准备好之前，工程造价资质不可能直接取消，只会一步步逐渐弱化。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28pt;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.8pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;mso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;mso-pagination:none\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">本次政策中取消的是造价咨询企业资质，并非造价师取消，所以证书的执业价值不会受到影响，含金量也只增不减。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28.1pt;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black\">从短期来看，</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">对造价咨询企业的影响不大，甚至会减少之前已女里取得甲级资质企业的竞争压力，尤其是承揽政府项目的企业。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"one-p\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; text-indent: 28.1pt;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black\">从长期来看，</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:black\">造价咨询公司会逐渐归于原本应该有的角色。会逐步将国内造价行业发展为以事务所为主的形式，与国际并轨。也能够防止市场上&ldquo;一家独大&rdquo;的情况出现，从根源上解决了垄断现象。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>"}